  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan breaks through the pegasus group to reach Ma Zun, Ma Ying Jie blocks his uncle from casting and takes the killer move himself, warning that using it will make cultivation fall. He names Dragon Horse Spirit; Snowy Mountain’s demonic path Gu Immortal Xue Song Zi specially prepared this move for them. Horses beside him neigh, bleed, and die; rainbow-like horse souls with coral-like dragon horns rise from the corpses as mutated horse souls and charge. Ordinary physical attacks do not affect those souls, and their self-destruction matches the soul explosion of a shark fin wolf.",
      "chapters": [
        542
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_ma_zun",
        "char_ma_ying_jie",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_xue_song_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan refuses a head-on clash and sends wolves to wear the souls down until they dim, disperse, or self-destruct. When Ma Zun retreats, Ma Ying Jie tries to intercept with remaining horse souls; Ma Zun then casts Dragon Horse Spirit himself and forms a tighter soul defense line than his nephew, hard to break even for a flying master. Maintaining it drains Ma Zun’s primeval essence; Fang Yuan splits the horse-soul line with wolf cones.",
      "chapters": [
        542
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "against-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan breaks Ma Zun’s barrier and kills him in three punches.",
      "chapters": [
        542
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-outcome",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Ma Ying Jie still names Dragon Horse Spirit as the powerful Snowy Mountain killer move he holds beside Ma Zun’s inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        579
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
